  WrittenDialogue: "And welcome to Helping Hands, I’m Kelly. Founder and CEO of the Helping Hands non-profit.\nHere we fund and dispatch little helpers around town for anyone in need.\nTwo years ago when a boy drown right before my eyes, there was no one qualified to come to the rescue.\nSince then, I’ve taken it upon myself to make sure CPR-certified life savers patrol every block. Out-covering the police 4 to 1.\nPlease sit back and relax as I get into the next chapter of our mission statement."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
